  "epilogue": "",
  "goals": "- G1 Safe builds: a build never destroys input, and a failed build leaves the existing output intact.\n- G2 Reliable runtime: PDF builds work with the venv or a PATH WeasyPrint, and installer flags do what they say.\n- G3 Profile management from the CLI: setting a default or removing a profile needs no hand-editing of config.toml.\n- G4 Batch builds: build several documents in one call.",
  "non_goals": "- Windows support, Pandoc option passthrough, and watch mode are out of scope for this roadmap."
